WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.821
Sylhet, twenty twenty-two.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.625
The maps stopped at the leaves.

3
00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:05.316
Then came NISAR.

4
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:08.879
Cameras see cloud. Most radar sees only rivers.

5
00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:11.399
NISAR finds the water beneath.

6
00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:15.713
Who lives beside it. How long it stays. A card for every village.

7
00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:19.308
Twenty-seven flooded forests. Fire, through smoke.

8
00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:21.858
Ground that moves. Ice that flows.

9
00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:23.366
Every number, checked.

10
00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:26.112
For relief teams, scientists and classrooms.

11
00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:28.140
Free, open, offline.

12
00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:29.700
Under the Canopy.
[Narration: AI voice clone of our narrator]
